      "content": "taking care of myself? how? how am i supposed to sleep or even look my kids in the eye knowing we're homeless because of me. every time i try to find a way out, there's just more debt, more paperwork, more nothing. it's like a trap. it feels like the only way to actually stop the pain and the constant crushing weight is to just... make it stop entirely. i just want the struggle to be over.",
